orgy@archlinux.org","committed_date":"2024-02-11T20:40:51.000+01:00","trailers":{},"extended_trailers":{},"web_url":"https://gitlab.archlinux.org/archlinux/packaging/packages/plymouth/-/commit/7cb8657687c1e21526a8956e5b2d0e8d295165c6"},{"id":"47c751764fe11fc8f9d824ffd7400010b444911d","short_id":"47c75176","created_at":"2024-01-20T04:31:28.000+01:00","parent_ids":["d7d323626cc1dcba1919b4235f1e8716202a769f"],"title":"Specify SPDX license identifier","message":"Specify SPDX license identifier\n","author_name":"Balló György","author_email":"bgyorgy@archlinux.org","authored_date":"2024-01-20T04:31:28.000+01:00","committer_name":"Balló György","committer_email":"bgyorgy@archlinux.org","committed_date":"2024-01-20T04:31:28.000+01:00","trailers":{},"extended_trailers":{},"web_url":"https://gitlab.archlinux.org/archlinux/packaging/packages/plymouth/-/commit/47c751764fe11fc8f9d824ffd7400010b444911d"},{"id":"d7d323626cc1dcba1919b4235f1e8716202a769f","short_id":"d7d32362","created_at":"2024-01-18T15:04:30.000+01:00","parent_ids":["7fc3620a1b3d2e809a429e02f954b73e33ae46f7"],"title":"upgpkg: 24.004.60-4","message":"upgpkg: 24.004.60-4\n\n- Fix fallback not working when fc-match isn't available (upstream patch).\n- Improve font string parsing.\n- Remove plymouthd-fd-escrow from initramfs since it's used only on shutdown.\n","author_name":"Balló György","author_email":"bgyorgy@archlinux.org","authored_date":"2024-01-18T15:04:30.000+01:00","committer_name":"Balló György","committer_email":"bgyorgy@archlinux.org","committed_date":"2024-01-18T15:04:30.000+01:00","trailers":{},"extended_trailers":{},"web_url":"https://gitlab.archlinux.org/archlinux/packaging/packages/plymouth/-/commit/d7d323626cc1dcba1919b4235f1e8716202a769f"},{"id":"7fc3620a1b3d2e809a429e02f954b73e33ae46f7","short_id":"7fc3620a","created_at":"2024-01-10T21:16:59.000+01:00","parent_ids":["9af2793d55a1f9d83aa5e4a323a0eb347d5e5e53"],"title":"upgpkg: 24.004.60-3","message":"upgpkg: 24.004.60-3\n\nAdd plymouthd-fd-escrow helper binary to the shutdown initramfs which is used by plymouth to hold on to the pixel-displays fds until the end.\n","author_name":"Balló György","author_email":"bgyorgy@archlinux.org","authored_date":"2024-01-10T21:16:59.000+01:00","committer_name":"Balló György","committer_email":"bgyorgy@archlinux.org","committed_date":"2024-01-10T21:16:59.000+01:00","trailers":{},"extended_trailers":{},"web_url":"https://gitlab.archlinux.org/archlinux/packaging/packages/plymouth/-/commit/7fc3620a1b3d2e809a429e02f954b73e33ae46f7"},{"id":"9af2793d55a1f9d83aa5e4a323a0eb347d5e5e53","short_id":"9af2793d","created_at":"2024-01-09T14:20:12.000+01:00","parent_ids":["e7712c095ea62829acfff81b536e0050530a3506"],"title":"upgpkg: 24.004.60-2","message":"upgpkg: 24.004.60-2\n\n- Use label-freetype instead of label-pango to reduce initramfs size. label-freetype is improved a lot in the recent releases, so it's stable enough to replace label-pango.\n\n- Install mkinitcpio shutdown hook and systemd drop-in snippet to include fonts in shutdown initramfs for Plymouth. This is needed to display the console messages during shutdown.\n","author_name":"Balló György","author_email":"bgyorgy@archlinux.org","authored_date":"2024-01-09T14:20:12.000+01:00","committer_name":"Balló György","committer_email":"bgyorgy@archlinux.org","committed_date":"2024-01-09T14:20:12.000+01:00","trailers":{},"extended_trailers":{},"web_url":"https://gitlab.archlinux.org/archlinux/packaging/packages/plymouth/-/commit/9af2793d55a1f9d83aa5e4a323a0eb347d5e5e53"},{"id":"e7712c095ea62829acfff81b536e0050530a3506","short_id":"e7712c09","created_at":"2024-01-07T10:52:37.000+01:00","parent_ids":["0f7d86661622b53b8ccfd4ee6efbaac7c5eb1102"],"title":"upgpkg: 24.004.60-1: Update to 24.004.60","message":"upgpkg: 24.004.60-1: Update to 24.004.60\n","author_name":"Antonio Rojas","author_email":"arojas@archlinux.org","authored_date":"2024-01-07T10:52:37.000+01:00","committer_name":"Antonio Rojas","committer_email":"arojas@archlinux.org","committed_date":"2024-01-07T10:52:37.000+01:00","trailers":{},"extended_trailers":{},"web_url":"https://gitlab.archlinux.org/archlinux/packaging/packages/plymouth/-/commit/e7712c095ea62829acfff81b536e0050530a3506"},{"id":"0f7d86661622b53b8ccfd4ee6efbaac7c5eb1102","short_id":"0f7d8666","created_at":"2023-12-26T18:39:00.000+01:00","parent_ids":["277c3c150245dc4c8d5c83077073270f010dc10f"],"title":"upgpkg: 23.360.11-1 - New upstream release","message":"upgpkg: 23.360.11-1 - New upstream release\n","author_name":"Balló György","author_email":"bgyorgy@archlinux.org","authored_date":"2023-12-26T18:39:00.000+01:00","committer_name":"Balló György","committer_email":"bgyorgy@archlinux.org","committed_date":"2023-12-26T18:39:00.000+01:00","trailers":{},"extended_trailers":{},"web_url":"https://gitlab.archlinux.org/archlinux/packaging/packages/plymouth/-/commit/0f7d86661622b53b8ccfd4ee6efbaac7c5eb1102"},{"id":"277c3c150245dc4c8d5c83077073270f010dc10f","short_id":"277c3c15","created_at":"2023-12-26T07:16:30.000+01:00","parent_ids":["9d8571530968bb864d1f50a694d90de931767f47"],"title":"upgpkg: 23.358.4-2 - Various fixes","message":"upgpkg: 23.358.4-2 - Various fixes\n\n- Add more needed dependencies for the new functionalities.\n- Fix systemd integration (with upstreamed patch).\n- Add monospace font to the initrd, used by the new virtual console functionality.\n- Add xkb info and x11 locale to the initrd, needed for the new /dev/input devices support.\n- Remove label-freetype.so from the initrd, because it's buggy, and label-pango.so is enough.\n","author_name":"Balló György","author_email":"bgyorgy@archlinux.org","authored_date":"2023-12-26T07:16:30.000+01:00","committer_name":"Balló György","committer_email":"bgyorgy@archlinux.org","committed_date":"2023-12-26T07:16:30.000+01:00","trailers":{},"extended_trailers":{},"web_url":"https://gitlab.archlinux.org/archlinux/packaging/packages/plymouth/-/commit/277c3c150245dc4c8d5c83077073270f010dc10f"},{"id":"9d8571530968bb864d1f50a694d90de931767f47","short_id":"9d857153","created_at":"2023-12-25T22:13:14.000+01:00","parent_ids":["4dd8f45e15f9e0be97c050e6745e7a0692efe2fe"],"title":"upgpkg: 23.358.4-1: Update to 23.358.4","message":"upgpkg: 23.358.4-1: Update to 23.358.4\n","author_name":"Antonio Rojas","author_email":"arojas@archlinux.org","authored_date":"2023-12-25T22:13:14.000+01:00","committer_name":"Antonio Rojas","committer_email":"arojas@archlinux.org","committed_date":"2023-12-25T22:13:14.000+01:00","trailers":{},"extended_trailers":{},"web_url":"https://gitlab.archlinux.org/archlinux/packaging/packages/plymouth/-/commit/9d8571530968bb864d1f50a694d90de931767f47"},{"id":"4dd8f45e15f9e0be97c050e6745e7a0692efe2fe","short_id":"4dd8f45e","created_at":"2023-12-23T16:03:38.000+01:00","parent_ids":["32fdb80c6debe619333550144f4ce6c0e2c0495f"],"title":"upgpkg: 23.356.9-2: Fix lib name in mkinitcpio install script","message":"upgpkg: 23.356.9-2: Fix lib name in mkinitcpio install script\n","author_name":"Antonio Rojas","author_email":"arojas@archlinux.org","authored_date":"2023-12-23T16:03:38.000+01:00","committer_name":"Antonio Rojas","committer_email":"arojas@archlinux.org","committed_date":"2023-12-23T16:03:38.000+01:00","trailers":{},"extended_trailers":{},"web_url":"https://gitlab.archlinux.org/archlinux/packaging/packages/plymouth/-/commit/4dd8f45e15f9e0be97c050e6745e7a0692efe2fe"},{"id":"32fdb80c6debe619333550144f4ce6c0e2c0495f","short_id":"32fdb80c","created_at":"2023-12-23T15:43:10.000+01:00","parent_ids":["401a266ebf8b170cc02c26a55447800295760ea2"],"title":"upgpkg: 23.356.9-1: Update to 23.356.9","message":"upgpkg: 23.356.9-1: Update to 23.356.9\n","author_name":"Antonio Rojas","author_email":"arojas@archlinux.org","authored_date":"2023-12-23T15:43:10.000+01:00","committer_name":"Antonio Rojas","committer_email":"arojas@archlinux.org","committed_date":"2023-12-23T15:43:10.000+01:00","trailers":{},"extended_trailers":{},"web_url":"https://gitlab.archlinux.org/archlinux/packaging/packages/plymouth/-/commit/32fdb80c6debe619333550144f4ce6c0e2c0495f"},{"id":"401a266ebf8b170cc02c26a55447800295760ea2","short_id":"401a266e","created_at":"2023-03-29T12:43:59.000+00:00","parent_ids":["f640bb11130d846e4619e35b63b85fa3945a2125"],"title":"Do not add /etc/vconsole.conf in initcpio hook, it's handled by sd-vconsole","message":"Do not add /etc/vconsole.conf in initcpio hook, it's handled by sd-vconsole","author_name":"Balló György","author_email":"bgyorgy@archlinux.org","authored_date":"2023-03-29T12:43:59.000+00:00","committer_name":"Balló György","committer_email":"bgyorgy@archlinux.org","committed_date":"2023-03-29T12:43:59.000+00:00","trailers":{},"extended_trailers":{},"web_url":"https://gitlab.archlinux.org/archlinux/packaging/packages/plymouth/-/commit/401a266ebf8b170cc02c26a55447800295760ea2"},{"id":"f640bb11130d846e4619e35b63b85fa3945a2125","short_id":"f640bb11","created_at":"2023-03-24T14:52:04.000+00:00","parent_ids":["df088501c9bf9b28b98ba58e7049ec8026edd8f8"],"title":"Do not add /etc/os-release in initcpio hook, it's handled by mkinitcpio itself","message":"Do not add /etc/os-release in initcpio hook, it's handled by mkinitcpio itself","author_name":"Balló György","author_email":"bgyorgy@archlinux.org","authored_date":"2023-03-24T14:52:04.000+00:00","committer_name":"Balló György","committer_email":"bgyorgy@archlinux.org","committed_date":"2023-03-24T14:52:04.000+00:00","trailers":{},"extended_trailers":{},"web_url":"https://gitlab.archlinux.org/archlinux/packaging/packages/plymouth/-/commit/f640bb11130d846e4619e35b63b85fa3945a2125"},{"id":"df088501c9bf9b28b98ba58e7049ec8026edd8f8","short_id":"df088501","created_at":"2023-03-21T01:25:10.000+00:00","parent_ids":[],"title":"Move plymouth from AUR with 580 votes","message":"Move plymouth from AUR with 580 votes","author_name":"Balló György","author_email":"bgyorgy@archlinux.org","authored_date":"2023-03-21T01:25:10.000+00:00","committer_name":"Balló György","committer_email":"bgyorgy@archlinux.org","committ